 "text": "Welcome to Dickinson County, MI\nHome\nGovernment\nCounty Services\nDickinson County Library\nDickinson County Fair\nHealth Department\nHospital Healthcare System\nRoad Commission\nConstruction Code\nFord Airport (IMT)\nVeterans Affairs\nMSU Extension\nCounty Departments\nBoard of Commissioners*\nCounty Controller\nCounty Court System\nCounty Clerk*\nRegister of Deeds*\nCounty Treasurer*\nEqualization\nSheriff's Department*\nLake Antoine Park/Campground\nDrain Commissioner*\nResidents\nLocal Area Information\nCities And Townships\nLocal Schools\nPublic Library and branches\nFor Pets and Wildlife\nRecreation\nTourist Information\nCounty Links\nCounty History Development\nCourthouse\nDemographic Information\nElected Officials\nFinancial Dashboard\nElections\nVoter Information\nEducation\nHealthCare\nSenior Citizens\nMilitary Veterans\nWelcome\nCities And Townships\nTourist Information\nRecreation\nBusiness\nCounty records information\nDemographic Information\nEmployment Opportunities\nHow Do I\nPay fines\nApply For\nAssumed Name DBAs\nBirth Certificates\nConcealed Weapons Licenses\nDeath Certificates\nDivorces\nMarriage Licenses\nEmployment Opportunities\nContact\nUseful Phone Numbers\nBoard Meeting Minutes\nRecording Documents\nFind Information On\nGo\nPrev Next\nCounty Treasurer\nHome Government County Departments County Treasurer\nSub Menu\nCounty information links\nCounty Controller\nBoard of Commissioners\nAgenda/approved minutes\nCounty Board Members\nDickinson County Committees\nCounty Clerk\nAssumed Name DBAs\nBirth Certificates\nConcealed Weapons Licenses\nDeath Certificates\nDivorces\nFelony fines\nMarriage Licenses/Certificate\nMilitary Discharge Papers (DD214)\nNotaries Public\nCounty land search\nRegister of Deeds\nRecording Documents\nMichigan Transfer Tax Exemptions\nDickinson County Transfer Tax Exemptions\nRegister Of Deeds Online Search\nMichigan Real Estate Transfer\nCounty Treasurer\nCourt System\nLegal terms\nCourt process\nEqualization\nParks\nCampsite Reservations\nPark pavilions\nLake Antoine Park Partners\nCampground Host Application\nPark Ordinance\nDrain Commissioner\nFord Airport\nMine Inspector\nSheriffs Department\nCounty Treasurer\nThe County Treasurer handles the following functions.\nLegal resources, available to taxpayers, can be found here\nFinancial Hardship Policy One-Year extension from Foreclosure\nFinancial Hardship Application for One-Year extension from Foreclosure\nReceive and deposit monies for various County departments\nInvest County monies\nPrepare monthly reconciliation of all investments and bank accounts\nPrepare monthly financial support\nReceive delinquent property taxes from local Cities and Townships\nPurchase the delinquent taxes and distribute the monies to the taxing units\nCollect delinquent taxes and maintain tax rolls\nLOOK UP and PAY Delinquent taxes online\nConduct the tax reversion process as the Foreclosing Governmental Unit\nCertify that there are no delinquent taxes on Warranty Deeds and Land Contracts before they can be recorded in the Register of Deeds office\nPrepare tax statements for taxpayers, banks, mortgage companies and realtors\nPrepare supplemental tax bills for homestead denials\nMake notice of intent to claim excess proceeds of tax foreclosures\nForms to claim remaining proceeds 540 541\nSell dog licenses\nPassports\nPlat books are sold on site only at the County Treasurer’s Office for $45 (Cash or Check). Shipping is not available\nOffice location:\n705 S. Stephenson Ave., Iron Mountain MI 49801\n(906) 774-8130 (906) 774-3183 Fax\nDickinson County officials as of 11-2020\nCounty Treasurer: Lorna Carey treaslorna@dickinsoncountymi.gov\nChief Deputy: Nancy McCole treasclerk@dickinsoncountymi.gov\nDeputy: Kelly Bousley kbousley@dickinsoncountymi.gov\nCounty Departments\nBoard Of Commissioners\nCounty Controller\nCounty Clerk\nRegister Of Deeds\nCounty Treasurer\nEqualization\nCounty Departments\nSheriff's Department\nParks\nFord Airport\nProsecuting Attorney\nCourt System\nQuicklinks\nContact information\nElections\nCalendar\nParks & Rec\nBirth, Death & Marriage Records\nTaxes\nTraffic Tickets\nSmall Claims\nMeeting Minutes & Agendas\nEmployment Opportunities\nPassport Information\nCounty Committee application for public\nContact Us\n705 S. Stephenson Ave.\nIron Mountain MI 49801\nMailing Address\nPO Box 609\nIron Mountain MI 49801\npowered by revize. , The Government Website Experts. |\nLogin\nSHARE\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.dickinsoncountymi.gov/government/county_departments/county_treasurer.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nGoogle Plus\nReddit\nClose",
